 "summary": "A board-mounted barrel socket for a DC supply plug with a 2.0 mm centre pin and a 5.5 mm outer diameter. It sits on its side with the plug entering parallel to the board, and solders through three slotted holes. Three terminals: the centre pin, the sleeve and a contact that rests on the sleeve. Rated 24 V DC and 5.0 A, -25 to 85 °C, 5,000 insertion cycles typical.",
